| Issue | OWASP Top‑10 | Why it matters |
|-------|--------------|----------------|
| **No security‑hardening middleware** (Helmet, CORS, Rate‑limit) | A5 – Security Misconfiguration | By default Express ships with the `X‑Powered‑By: Express` header, permissive CORS, no CSP, no HSTS, etc. |
